00:41:39.890 --> 00:41:43.310
Your nephew is not married to the Lady of the Camillas.

00:41:43.410 --> 00:41:46.510
He has no wife, but he believes he has, which is the same thing.

00:41:46.520 --> 00:41:49.720
Why did he pick on Marguerite Gautier?

00:41:49.720 --> 00:41:51.700
Another martyr for love.

00:42:00.410 --> 00:42:02.880
