00:55:59.250 --> 00:56:00.000
Call me Grace.

00:56:00.350 --> 00:56:01.270
As I don't speak French.

00:56:01.810 --> 00:56:02.850
Grace, a good name.

00:56:03.010 --> 00:56:04.210
