herself. Oh, she has claw. Look, this is my pad now, remember? If you want to keep kibbutzing

01:18:14.220 --> 01:18:18.720
here, just belt up on the snide remarks or you'll find yourself horizontal. A position

01:18:18.720 --> 01:18:24.090
you're clearly familiar with. Now look here, you granite-faced old bloated... How dare you speak

01:18:24.090 --> 01:18:30.000
to me like that? Why can't you look at my back? I keep telling you I'm a psychiatrist. Just because I'm

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:38.020
the national health isn't it? Damn money-grubbers. You and your hypocrite self. Wait a minute.

01:18:38.020 --> 01:18:57.050
Will you two shut up? It's Dr. Herder! I've come to offer my congratulations on the wedding.

01:18:57.050 --> 01:19:00.000
Dr. Herder, this is Lady Grey.

01:19:04.090 --> 01:19:09.240
How do you do, Doctor? So nice to meet you at last. You'll stay to lunch. I want to talk

01:19:09.240 --> 01:19:12.700
