01:19:12.700 --> 01:19:18.680
the wedding. But we didn't invite anybody except the close family. Besides, you'd have

01:19:18.680 --> 01:19:22.400
tried to talk me out of it. And it wouldn't have done any good.

01:19:22.400 --> 01:19:30.000
I love him. You should have consulted me before you went ahead. This madness. Come, Doctor.

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:32.020
you said he needed a harsh dose of reality.

01:19:33.560 --> 01:19:36.340
Well, you can't get a harsher dose of the stuff than marriage.

01:19:37.340 --> 01:19:38.240
It can't be legal.

01:19:38.730 --> 01:19:39.450
It's legal.

01:19:40.110 --> 01:19:41.650
My brother-in-law conducted the service.

01:19:41.770 --> 01:19:42.230
He's a bishop.

01:19:43.940 --> 01:19:45.080
What do you say, Lady Clare?

01:19:47.250 --> 01:19:47.610
Congratulations.

01:19:50.290 --> 01:19:50.690
Congratulations.

01:19:51.490 --> 01:19:53.310
On getting your Goldenheim grant.

01:19:55.850 --> 01:19:57.480
Yes, congratulations, old boy.

01:19:57.920 --> 01:20:00.000
I heard a word with the chairman, told him you were a saint.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:01.000
Sit down, fellow.

01:20:01.000 --> 01:20:02.780
Sit down.

01:20:02.780 --> 01:20:18.690
Help yourself to coffee, doctor.

01:20:18.690 --> 01:20:21.970
You made love to me to make sure I wouldn't cause any trouble.

01:20:21.970 --> 01:20:26.250
You seduced me to make sure of the 130,000 pounds for your schizophrenic rats.

01:20:26.250 --> 01:20:27.270
Oh.

01:20:27.270 --> 01:20:28.360
Don't be tiresome.

01:20:34.030 --> 01:20:35.330
It's all right, they agreed to be cut.

01:20:36.920 --> 01:20:41.270
See the sunflower in the center, and the roses, and three sweet Williams,

01:20:41.510 --> 01:20:44.250
and all bound in cantor evergreen for loving memory.

01:20:45.200 --> 01:20:46.470
And I mean every word of it.

01:20:47.490 --> 01:20:50.090
They're beautiful. Thank you.

01:20:51.240 --> 01:20:53.660
I've shaken the silver gong of the universe.

01:20:53.660 --> 01:20:55.960
Boom!

01:21:00.090 --> 01:21:07.840
it's hard. Love is my theme and it frightens them. Happiness my gift and they run. I try

01:21:07.840 --> 01:21:16.000
to tie the air in knots and make mountains out of water. Hopeless, darling. That's not

01:21:16.000 --> 01:21:23.140
a word in love's lexicon. We'll hear the voice of the turtle throughout the land. Yes?

01:21:40.200 --> 01:21:43.200
I don't like being made a fool of Claire.

01:21:43.200 --> 01:21:45.200
Nobody's making a fool of you.

01:21:45.200 --> 01:21:48.850
The Gurneys must have an heir.

01:21:48.850 --> 01:21:51.870
As soon as there is one, Charles will have JC committed.

01:21:51.870 --> 01:21:54.490
The only way you can change the plot, Doctor,

01:21:54.490 --> 01:21:57.490
is by making the 14th Earl of Gurney sane, like the rest of us.

01:21:57.490 --> 01:22:00.000
You haven't much time.

01:22:01.400 --> 01:22:04.960
Lady Grace isn't the type to survive the rabbit test for long.

01:22:14.620 --> 01:22:18.240
Your Lordship, this is the first of a series of experiments

01:22:18.240 --> 01:22:20.420
I'm going to conduct with your hand.

01:22:20.420 --> 01:22:22.590
Ask and thou shalt receive.

01:22:22.590 --> 01:22:26.120
Experiment one.

01:22:31.530 --> 01:22:32.510
What does that look like?

01:22:34.240 --> 01:22:35.120
Is it a dragon?

01:22:36.770 --> 01:22:37.250
A spider?

01:22:38.480 --> 01:22:39.760
What does it remind you of?

01:22:45.200 --> 01:22:55.190
Everything it is, or ever shall be,

01:22:55.810 --> 01:22:56.750
reminds me of me.

01:22:57.570 --> 01:23:00.000
If it didn't remind you of you, what?

01:23:00.540 --> 01:23:01.580
Would it remind you all?

01:23:05.630 --> 01:23:06.390
An inkblot.

01:23:07.180 --> 01:23:11.180
Your lordship, this is a lie detector.

01:23:11.660 --> 01:23:14.480
It will give us an objective truth.

01:23:15.770 --> 01:23:16.630
Experiment 7.

01:23:19.450 --> 01:23:22.610
Your lordship, are you God?

01:23:24.320 --> 01:23:26.190
No.

01:23:27.550 --> 01:23:30.000
Doctor, this machine says...

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:35.910
he's lying. For experiment 11, I've asked his lordship to visit ward C. That's where we keep

01:23:35.910 --> 01:23:40.230
some of the more extreme mental patients. I'm hoping they may provide a beneficial shock.

01:23:40.230 --> 01:23:47.250
But isn't it dangerous? No, no, no, no. I have an assistant outside and inside. Besides,

01:23:47.250 --> 01:23:51.960
you haven't given me much time, so I'm forced to try unorthodox methods. He's been inside

01:23:51.960 --> 01:23:57.590
for about 20 minutes. There was a lot of shouting at first, but now listen.

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:32.160
J.C.'s got labor pains, too.

01:24:32.160 --> 01:24:35.360
Hmm. It's called couvard, sympathetic illness.

01:24:35.360 --> 01:24:37.720
Psychosomatic, not at all unusual.

01:24:37.720 --> 01:24:40.720
Oh, but I never felt anything when Lady Clare was pregnant.

01:24:40.720 --> 01:24:41.960
I'm sure you didn't.

01:24:41.960 --> 01:24:43.440
Oh!

01:24:43.440 --> 01:24:45.300
Oh!

01:24:45.300 --> 01:24:49.170
Mighty Mouse is roaring.

01:24:49.170 --> 01:24:51.080
What are you up to now?

01:24:51.080 --> 01:24:53.080
A colleague of mine is sending me some help.

01:24:53.080 --> 01:24:55.160
Yes, a personal favor.

01:24:55.160 --> 01:24:57.940
Do you need us here?

01:24:57.940 --> 01:25:00.000
Yes, but what ever happened...

01:25:00.060 --> 01:25:02.150
You must not interfere.

01:25:02.150 --> 01:25:10.510
I'm going to prove that it's impossible for two objects to occupy the same space at the same time.

01:25:10.510 --> 01:25:13.790
Dr. Herder, Mr. McKeil is here.

01:25:13.790 --> 01:25:15.690
Good. Show them straight in.

01:25:15.690 --> 01:25:19.320
Certainly, sir. I'll just lie down on the doorstep and let it walk over me.

01:25:19.320 --> 01:25:26.120
JC, I am going to show you the world in the hard light of truth.

01:25:26.120 --> 01:25:29.540
I am the light of truth, the light of the world.

01:25:32.460 --> 01:25:34.230
This is experiment 15.

01:25:34.230 --> 01:25:49.210
Shall we get on with it?

01:25:49.210 --> 01:25:50.690
Let me introduce you first.

01:25:50.690 --> 01:25:52.500
Oh, there's no need.

01:25:52.500 --> 01:25:55.220
I'm sure they all know me here.

01:25:55.220 --> 01:25:59.500
Who else has electricity streaming from his eyeballs and from his fingers?

01:26:01.470 --> 01:26:03.800
I'm the high voltage messiah.

01:26:03.800 --> 01:26:06.080
