02:16:52.570 --> 02:16:56.150
Never!

02:16:56.150 --> 02:16:58.770
Proof, have you?

02:16:58.770 --> 02:16:59.480
Don't need proof, I know.

02:17:00.000 --> 02:17:04.060
Heal thyself. You suddenly know, against all the evidence,

02:17:04.060 --> 02:17:06.730
you don't need proof from anybody or anything.

02:17:06.730 --> 02:17:10.950
This monstrous belief of yours that I'm guilty is a clear case of paranoia.

02:17:10.950 --> 02:17:14.130
