02:17:14.130 --> 02:17:17.450
If they ask about me at the trial, tell them the truth.

02:17:17.450 --> 02:17:19.170
What truth?

02:17:19.170 --> 02:17:21.170
That I'm 100% normal.

02:17:23.180 --> 02:17:24.130
Her, Doctor.

02:17:30.730 --> 02:17:37.300
