02:17:53.930 --> 02:17:57.590
He's trying to blackmail me into saying he's completely normal, he's normal.

02:18:01.560 --> 02:18:27.940
Claire's death, one of those terrible eyeless, nothing to do with the case, unpleasant as he is, the good lords himself again, my head's splitting, I've had an abdomen full of the upper classes.

