02:19:30.990 --> 02:19:33.890
Jack, let's take off. It's been hell here. We need a holiday.

02:19:34.090 --> 02:19:34.590
Good idea.

02:19:35.030 --> 02:19:37.690
No, I'm taking my seat in the House of Lords.

02:19:38.870 --> 02:19:39.650
What?

02:19:39.760 --> 02:19:42.420
What now? So soon after your illness?

02:19:43.620 --> 02:19:45.080
Well, I mean, are you ready for them?

02:19:45.880 --> 02:19:47.540
Are they ready for me, Matt?

02:19:48.450 --> 02:19:50.610
We're going to work as a team once I'm elected.

02:19:51.290 --> 02:19:53.710
Jack in the House of Lords, me in the other place.

02:19:54.030 --> 02:19:55.770
We think alike about a lot of things.

02:19:55.770 --> 02:19:57.630
