02:20:00.030 --> 02:20:02.570
You're so bloody tactful, Charles.

02:20:02.670 --> 02:20:06.050
Look, if Jack thinks he's ready for them, then I'm with him all the way.

02:20:06.150 --> 02:20:08.730
Me too. It's out of the question.

02:20:08.830 --> 02:20:10.380
