02:20:12.570 --> 02:20:15.710
Nobody asked a question, so I'll ask a question.

02:20:15.810 --> 02:20:17.810
Who is the head of the Gurney family?

02:20:17.910 --> 02:20:20.690
Well, you are, Jack.

02:20:20.790 --> 02:20:24.190
