02:20:53.230 --> 02:20:56.280
White, watery dribbles away, and it's hard!

02:20:56.280 --> 02:21:00.000
Because inside you're still 20 years old.

02:21:00.120 --> 02:21:03.200
but your feet go flop, flop, flop, and...

02:21:42.640 --> 02:21:44.850
