02:21:44.850 --> 02:21:47.460
Fair enough. That's enough, that's enough.

02:21:47.460 --> 02:21:51.640
You've had a good innings, but it's milk rusks and beddy-bys for you.

02:22:04.760 --> 02:22:07.280
You're more than just cured, Jack.

02:22:07.400 --> 02:22:11.840
You've got that something extra, what we call star quality.

02:22:11.880 --> 02:22:14.480
It will be a triumphant climax.

02:22:14.500 --> 02:22:20.420
