02:22:39.620 --> 02:22:44.120
I have a big day ahead of me. I'm speaking in the House of Lords.

02:22:44.200 --> 02:22:47.410
Don't worry. It's only nerves. You'll kill 'em.

02:22:47.650 --> 02:22:52.280
